    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aTracking Killer\u300b is a role-playing game set against the backdrop of modern crime investigation. In the game, you will play the role of a detective, conducting on-site investigations and investigations, sorting out the case, collecting evidence, and apprehending the murderer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Tips\uff1aE key - start/stop view control, Tab - squat/stand up\u3011</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Famous billionaire dies mysteriously</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early in the morning, I received a report of a homicide case, and the founder of a well-known local law firm, Su Hongwen, died suddenly. The cause of death is unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656480/extras/889ade63f7061ca9775bfbd59cfb0cb8.avif?t=1746705694\" width=700 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survey the site and search for clues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly simulating the criminal investigation process, focusing on the detailed investigation of the death scene of wealthy individuals by detectives, starting from environmental traces, personal belongings and other details, to uncover hidden clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656480/extras/4aff782bd00578a35a8e7e1f4aeb7165.avif?t=1746705694\" width=700 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visit and investigate, identify the perpetrator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will focus on conducting visits and investigations, starting from the relevant personnel who came into contact with the deceased before and after the time of death, to explore the interests and conflicts between individuals, and gradually identify the perpetrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656480/extras/b975545ab80933f8e35de544c50002c7.avif?t=1746705694\" width=700 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Peel off the cocoon layer by layer, delving deeper and deeper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through continuous investigation of evidence and testimony, layer by layer, the interests behind the deceased are constantly unlocked, the motive and method of the crime are discovered, and the perpetrator is identified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656480/extras/e9f426f2955bbe6629dfca5d7bb4b5c9.avif?t=1746705694\" width=700 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is the murderer? Wait for you to uncover it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >relatives? friend? cooperative partner? Private caregiver? workers? Many characters, who is the murderer? Waiting for you to decide and restore the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656480/extras/534032a06129f2dbcf233496892d695b.avif?t=1746705694\" width=700 height=264 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aTracking Killer\u300b is a role-playing game set against the backdrop of modern crime investigation. In the game, you will play the role of a detective, conducting on-site investigations and investigations, sorting out the case, collecting evidence, and apprehending the murderer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Tips\uff1aE key - start/stop view control, Tab - squat/stand up\u3011</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Famous billionaire dies mysteriously</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early in the morning, I received a report of a homicide case, and the founder of a well-known local law firm, Su Hongwen, died suddenly. The cause of death is unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656480/extras/889ade63f7061ca9775bfbd59cfb0cb8.avif?t=1746705694\" width=700 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survey the site and search for clues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly simulating the criminal investigation process, focusing on the detailed investigation of the death scene of wealthy individuals by detectives, starting from environmental traces, personal belongings and other details, to uncover hidden clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656480/extras/4aff782bd00578a35a8e7e1f4aeb7165.avif?t=1746705694\" width=700 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visit and investigate, identify the perpetrator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will focus on conducting visits and investigations, starting from the relevant personnel who came into contact with the deceased before and after the time of death, to explore the interests and conflicts between individuals, and gradually identify the perpetrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656480/extras/b975545ab80933f8e35de544c50002c7.avif?t=1746705694\" width=700 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Peel off the cocoon layer by layer, delving deeper and deeper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through continuous investigation of evidence and testimony, layer by layer, the interests behind the deceased are constantly unlocked, the motive and method of the crime are discovered, and the perpetrator is identified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656480/extras/e9f426f2955bbe6629dfca5d7bb4b5c9.avif?t=1746705694\" width=700 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is the murderer? Wait for you to uncover it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >relatives? friend? cooperative partner? Private caregiver? workers? Many characters, who is the murderer? Waiting for you to decide and restore the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656480/extras/534032a06129f2dbcf233496892d695b.avif?t=1746705694\" width=700 height=264 /></span></p>",
